msgid ""
"Output buffer whose dtype also determines accumulation precision. Sub-byte "
"numeric dtypes (such as FP4/int4) are unsupported; use float16/float32 or an "
"integer dtype of at least 8 bits. Boolean reductions are allowed. The input "
"may use a narrower dtype."
